stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Authority
  Authority --> Refused: config_reentry_refused · config_format_retired · config_missing · settings_invalid
  Authority --> WorkerLaunch: entry and settings accepted
  WorkerLaunch --> Refused: worker_missing · worker_identity_mismatch
  WorkerLaunch --> Evaluating: hello accepted
  state Evaluating {
    [*] --> Script
    Script --> HostCall: a host function call
    HostCall --> Script: reply as data, failures included
  }
  Evaluating --> Judging: worker sends its result
  Evaluating --> Stopping: whole deadline · signal · breach of a bound of the evaluation · worker died
  Stopping --> Refused: host work stopped, worker reaped
  Judging --> Refused: config_refused · selection_malformed · selection_abstained
  Judging --> Reaped: selection checked
  Reaped --> Launch: worker reaped, runtime shut down
  Launch --> [*]
  Refused --> [*]
